('No shot on target against Costa Rica.', 'Aucun tir cadré contre le Costa Rica.', 'Hakuna shuti lililolenga lango dhidi ya Costa Rica.', 'Nenhum chute no alvo contra a Costa Rica.'),
('No shot on target against Mexico.', 'Aucun tir cadré contre le Mexique.', 'Hakuna shuti lililolenga lango dhidi ya Mexico.', 'Nenhum chute no alvo contra o México.'),
